    <span class="hero-eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>Trust, made visible.</h1>
    <p>Tourists often find it hard to discover verified local artisans, traditional
    workshops and community-led experiences — and when they do, unclear pricing and
    unverifiable hosts get in the way of booking. BeyondArk was built for Smart India
    Hackathon 2026 (PS 50) to close that gap.</p>
    <p>Every artisan on the platform completes an identity verification step before they
    can publish an experience, every listing carries a transparent, all-inclusive price,
    and every location is shown on an integrated map — with descriptions available in
    more than one language so the barrier to a real, local experience is as small as
    possible.</p>
